OL,3,CCommunities rally to raise more than
OL,4,C#125,000 for wildfire victims
OL,6,FCommunities in the West Midlands are
OL,7,F"rallying together" to support
OL,8,Fwildfire victims, with more than
OL,9,F#125,000 raised in GoFundMe appeals.
OL,11,FThe money is being donated to those
OL,12,Faffected by major blazes in
OL,13,FStourbridge, Birmingham, Pershore and
OL,14,FStoke-on-Trent.
OL,16,FWildfires ravaged across areas of the
OL,17,FUK this week as temperatures soared
OL,18,Fand the hottest day of the year was
OL,19,Frecorded.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@SO]
