OL,3,CCommunities rally to raise more than
OL,4,C#125,000 for wildfire victims
OL,6,FThe Heart of England Community
OL,7,FFoundation launched an emergency
OL,8,Fappeal on Friday evening to co-
OL,9,Fordinate support for affected families.
OL,11,FAs of Saturday morning, the charity
OL,12,Fsupporting communities across the West
OL,13,FMidlands and Warwickshire, has raised
OL,14,Fmore than #50,000.
OL,16,FChief executive Tina Costello said all
OL,17,Fmoney raised will be distributed to
OL,18,Fthose affected by the fires.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,343,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786893492
OL,3,CCommunities rally to raise more than
OL,4,C#125,000 for wildfire victims
OL,6,FShe said: "As the community foundation
OL,7,Ffor the West Midlands and
OL,8,FWarwickshire, we felt it was the right
OL,9,Fthing to do to start a campaign."
OL,11,FMs Costello, who has been with the
OL,12,Forganisation for 20 years, said they
OL,13,Fare "in a position to raise money and
OL,14,Fdeliver it really quickly".
OL,16,FShe said: "What's really important is
OL,17,Fthat this money goes to the people and
OL,18,Fthe families that are affected and
OL,19,Fimpacted by it.
OL,26,@nD@KOUqD@aO]uD@EOUvD@ZO]xD@KOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/7
