CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786893492
OL,3,CCommunities rally to raise more than
OL,4,C#125,000 for wildfire victims
OL,6,F"So tomorrow (Monday) we'll be linking
OL,7,Fit with key agencies in the area to
OL,8,Factually find out what kind of support
OL,9,Fis needed."
OL,11,FAsked how the region has been
OL,12,Faffected, she said: "I would say
OL,13,Fpeople are feeling genuinely sad.
OL,14,FThey've lost everything."
OL,16,FMs Costello said: "the communities are
OL,17,Frallying together".
