OL,3,CCommunities rally to raise more than
OL,4,C#125,000 for wildfire victims
OL,6,FIn Stourbridge in the Dudley borough,
OL,7,Fmore than #20,690 has been raised
OL,8,Facross three appeals for families who
OL,9,Fhave lost their homes in the wildfires.
OL,11,FSix separate appeals have been set up
OL,12,Ffor families who have lost their homes
OL,13,Fon Gorleston Road in Birmingham, with
OL,14,Fmore than #32,000 raised as of
OL,15,FSaturday morning.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/7
