PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786893492
OL,3,CCommunities rally to raise more than
OL,4,C#125,000 for wildfire victims
OL,6,FA fundraiser for those affected by the
OL,7,Ffires in Pershore, Worcestershire, has
OL,8,Fraised more than #11,700 so far, while
OL,9,Fan appeal in Stoke-on-Trent,
OL,10,FStaffordshire, has collected more than
OL,11,F#11,100.
OL,13,FThe GoFundMe appeals describe the
OL,14,Fdevastation caused to families, with
OL,15,Fmany losing pets in the fires.
OL,17,FEarlier this week, Dudley Borough
OL,18,FCouncil warned residents to remain
OL,19,F"vigilant" when donating to
OL,20,Ffundraising campaigns after being made
OL,21,Faware of fake pages shared online.
OL,26,@{D@AOU{D@JO]
