PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F342A1786893492
OL,3,CCommunities rally to raise more than
OL,4,C#125,000 for wildfire victims
OL,6,FGoFundMe has also offered guidance on
OL,7,Fhow to spot fake fundraising pages,
OL,8,Fincluding carefully checking web
OL,9,Faddresses to ensure financial
OL,10,Fcontributions are made via legitimate
OL,11,Fplatforms, and donating to platforms
OL,12,Fwith a donor guarantee so that money
OL,13,Fcan be refunded if something is not
OL,14,Fright.
OL,16,FDonors should also consider who told
OL,17,Fthem about the fundraiser, and are
OL,18,Fadvised to contact customer care teams
OL,19,Fif there is any uncertainty.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/7
